@FoodFlow.Api_HostAddress = http://127.0.0.1:5000

GET {{FoodFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health/
Accept: application/json

### Login with a demo customer
POST {{FoodFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "FoodFlow@123"
}

### Public restaurant catalog
GET {{FoodFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/restaurants/
Accept: application/json
